":null},{"id":410064485,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw0MTAwNjQ0ODU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/needs%20testing","name":"needs testing","color":"ffcc44","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","number":25,"title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":343,"closed_issues":2335,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T06:28:22Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-06-01T02:45:25Z","updated_at":"2026-06-18T12:00:59Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nv4.7.beta3.official [860821708]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.beta3 - Windows 10 (build 19045) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1080 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.6614) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-10600KF CPU @ 4.10GHz (12 threads) - 15.92 GiB memory - WASAPI (48000 Hz, Surround 7.1)\n\n### Issue description\n\nThe documented maximum texture size for a `Texture2D` is 16384x16384.\n\n`DrawableTexture2D` also checks that the size is not greater than this maximum:\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/86082170822e19ebb619c7f53c8fe54a6f8d3d2a/scene/resources/drawable_texture_2d.cpp#L60-L62\n\nYet in `texture_storage.cpp` (for both gles3 and rd) we enforce a maximum size of 16383x16383 (1x1 smaller)\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/86082170822e19ebb619c7f53c8fe54a6f8d3d2a/servers/rendering/renderer_rd/storage_rd/texture_storage.cpp#L1289-L1294\n\nI haven't hit any issues with changing this value to allow 16384x16384 textures, Drawable Textures seem to work fine for me at this size.\n\nGiven the mismatch, I assume this is a bug and we should be allowing for the much nicer power of 2 value of 16384?\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\ncall DrawableTexture2D.setup(16384, 16384. DrawableTexture2D.DRAWABLE_FORMAT_RGBA8)\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nrun the following EditorScript:\n```gdscript\n@tool\nextends EditorScript\n\nfunc _run() -> void:\n\tvar dt = DrawableTexture2D.new()\n\tdt.setup(16384, 16384, DrawableTexture2D.DRAWABLE_FORMAT_RGBA8)\n```","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119928/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119928/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}